WEBVTT

00:09:59.216 --> 00:10:00.970
and they've signed it because they believe

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.298
that people have a right to know

00:10:02.298 --> 00:10:04.673
about what they're eating.

00:10:04.673 --> 00:10:09.856
(Applause)

00:10:10.464 --> 00:10:12.420
Fishermen like it too, so there's a good chance

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.020
we can get the kind of support we need

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:14.954
to get this bill through,

00:10:14.954 --> 00:10:16.478
and it comes at a critical time,

00:10:16.478 --> 00:10:18.584
because this is the way we stop seafood fraud,

00:10:18.584 --> 00:10:20.650
this is the way we curb illegal fishing,

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.522
and this is the way we make sure

00:10:22.522 --> 00:10:24.226
that quotas, habitat protection,

00:10:24.226 --> 00:10:26.106
and bycatch reductions can do the jobs

00:10:26.106 --> 00:10:27.283
they can do.

00:10:27.283 --> 00:10:30.459
We know that we can manage
our fisheries sustainably.